Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother...{*Nii-san...}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've sure grown up, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that there was no way I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}knew{\i0} you were {*}my brother{*Nii-san}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you run from me on the roof without telling me anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have talked to you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kill all Jaegers on sight."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one of the orders we vampires have been given.{It's been decided that that is a rule among us vampires}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.28,0:00:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So you did become a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's honestly absurd for me to be sitting with you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.55,0:00:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can smell them too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:01:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they don't have total trust in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When I shot you, my orders were to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.25,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no desire to end the life of my precious little brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so I intentionally missed your vitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you didn't use guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right, I once taught you how to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.55,0:01:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If I recall, I said not to use guns since they'll dull your sense of smell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.02,0:01:31.40,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,That doesn't apply to me now that I've become a vampire.{is he saying that that conversation basically took place in a different world than his current form?}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.31,0:01:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you become a Jaeger?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I really need to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.11,0:01:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It was for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill all those who took our mom and brethren away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.69,0:01:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Jaeger, and I'm a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.79,0:01:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,As things are, we're eventually going to be forced to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:02:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you {\i1}had{\i0} been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I've found you, my only living family,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're telling me that we have to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what I should say!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.33,0:02:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll say this as your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.16,0:02:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:23.00,OP,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
