Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:53.07,OP,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Iba. I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,General...{in America at least, generally people address military members by base title, e.g. a Sergeant First Class would be addressed as "Sergeant" if you're just using the title.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit here until we get to the next station.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get there, we're going to have you call your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Miss Ryouko{*Ojou-sama}?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing on this train?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.69,0:04:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm, well—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to eat this with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, {*}brother{*Nii-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.55,0:04:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell just by looking into your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not cut out to be an avenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,An avenger's eyes are filled with anger, hatred, sadness, and despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yours are just those of an upset child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My entire purpose in life has been to kill vampires!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to drive all the other vampires to extinction first
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:05:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and leave me for the very end?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.37,0:05:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.43,0:05:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.92,0:05:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to kill every vampire that you can, as quickly as possible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.13,0:05:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll never have a better chance then this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't try to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.55,0:05:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never be cold-hearted enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget about it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget me, forget Dogville,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,forget Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.17,0:05:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And forget about the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.17,0:05:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you still choose to appear before me as a Jaeger,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.22,0:05:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll no longer be my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.82,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{\an8}Look at all those scars.{is this really audible?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.82,0:05:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Iba. If you're here to deliver my death sentence, then I'm glad that it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't talk nonsense, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.37,0:06:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly happened out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've received a report that there was an accident at the exercises in Fuji—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.54,0:06:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a one-sided slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Slaughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.25,0:06:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I let many men die last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine that they just wanted us as lab rats from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Alma Company?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We were dancing in the palm of their hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.65,0:06:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have stayed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have never gotten involved with a monster with such a despicable origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.71,0:06:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,General, what exactly—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We must not bring it into the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must be done!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.78,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.85,0:06:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on this train?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I see our prey, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:06:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's heading this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The hunt begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Chasing after your crush is a pretty aggressive move for a well-bred girl like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My crush?! No, it's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.07,0:07:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that I'm kind of interested in Yuliy{**-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we call a crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy doesn't really get romance,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't think it'll be easy making him yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm telling you that that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, the worlds you live in are too different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Yuliy{**-san}—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.19,0:07:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Or, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all doing some kind of dangerous work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.78,0:07:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You've...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.68,0:07:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take that food and go ask Yuliy yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to change the—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.65,0:08:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Momose Naotora, head of the Hyakko Party,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,am claiming this train for the cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-The Hyakko Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why are we stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:28.94,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{\an8}Someone call the conductor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A group claiming to be the\N Hyakko Party have attacked the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hyakko Party?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The soldiers riding this train are currently attempting to prevent their advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.93,0:08:41.16,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,Why would they...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.78,0:08:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Protecting the civilians is our top priority!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.41,0:08:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the attackers near the passenger cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Major Iba, could you go and help take command?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Moving to assist!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please don't push!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.18,0:09:05.73,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Dorothea{**-san}, what should we—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You escape with the rest of the passengers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You'll never hit me with shooting like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For all the Hyakko Party's lofty claims about making the world better,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,it would seem that they're no more noble then any other band of robbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because {*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama} is taken by you\Ndoesn't mean that you can do whatever you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This commotion is all because you cut off their funding and turned a blind eye to the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There are Jaegers here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish, lowly humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:10:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They're nothing more than hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Or was there a wolf among them, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave this place to Klarwein.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikhail. How about you use those claws and fangs of yours for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out, they've taken the freight car!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep them away from the passenger car!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Everyone with a gun get to the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.33,0:10:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get separated! Stay in groups and go under the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.87,0:10:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Find Kershner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He and his treasure should be on this train somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.04,0:10:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this strange suit of armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be the new weapon they—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Some sort of mechanism?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Very entertaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it! Nicely done for a pack of monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Start the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And find Kershner!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Find him, tie him up, and throw him down at my feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:11:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and jump off, Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Major, the train's changed tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.11,0:12:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they planning on stealing this whole train?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, Ume{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ume!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, {*}Mister{*Onii-chan}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ume{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you still choose to appear before me as a Jaeger,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you'll no longer be my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.19,0:12:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:13:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep shooting! Don't give them an inch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't falter! Show them what samurai are made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, what the hell's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fallon, follow that train.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.17,0:13:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:53.18,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He used his body to protect us!\NWhat an excellent fellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What's wrong, comrades? Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:01.80,Default,,2,2,0,,{\an8}With him at our side, we'll never need to worry about...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:01.80,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Deary me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's start the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As my servant, wreck havoc to your heart's content!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.33,0:14:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Showa Restoration is upon us!{consistency w/ ep. 4}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They got the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.47,0:15:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's nobody in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.81,0:15:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we just leave it, it'll stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.15,0:15:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The tire's blown!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.01,0:15:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.85,0:15:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorothea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.83,0:15:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What? There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I can't recognize my team members?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.93,0:15:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.69,0:15:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The rail ends up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.94,0:15:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And from here to there is all downhill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Fallon, give me the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Find Dorothea and Yuliy and then stop that train!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorothea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.55,0:16:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get here faster next time!{reverting to literal to flow better into next line}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's a bit unreasonable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Disconnecting the car behind us should help a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.95,0:16:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! Put that beef to use!{Nice gains bro!}{Nice gorilla-ness!}{Being a gorilla comes in handy!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.95,0:16:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.66,0:16:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna run out of rail!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything you people do is crazy! {Everyone, what mad/absurd/reckless things(you do)}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That jump was what's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.69,0:16:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was surely fate that led us to meet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me assist y—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{*}Brother{*Nii-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought I'd never meet you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Despite that,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.07,0:17:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Despite that, I always...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I always wanted to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you give off the same smell as them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're standing in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not going to move...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pulling back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.14,0:17:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Regroup with the soldiers in the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the nuisance from the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.45,0:18:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a newspaper reporter who's been investigating us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And why would that reporter happen to be carrying a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're chasing down risky leads, you...{cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Miss Ryouko{*Ojou-sama}.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.37,0:18:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've cut a person...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's not a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}According to his seven-year-old daughter,\Nthe doctor turned into glowing ash and disappeared.{Check against final script for 02.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.73,0:18:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a reporter, that'll probably make a better story than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Never seen one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That there's a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.85,0:19:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I never even imagined that I'd get data on fighting Jaegers so soon!{cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot! There's no stopping him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after I said all that, you still came?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Fitting, since you've always been toddling after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:20:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop anymore, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put you to rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:21:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If I ever end up like him,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to be the one to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have the Ark...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.44,0:21:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have the Ark of Sirius, you'll be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To kill, and to let live.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.59,0:21:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.87,0:21:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.73,0:21:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We've had to take quite the detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But when compared to our coming thousand years...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.58,0:21:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to our coming eternity,\Nit was but a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.10,0:22:00.11,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:13.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.75}What an unbearable end
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.28,0:22:11.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{OP lyrics start}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:20.60,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.75}I breath out, breath out, breath out, and stop
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.15,0:22:28.11,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}As I'm fleeing from this cruel world, I fall into a deep sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.53,0:22:34.71,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}I hide behind the words "I'm doing my best"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.71,0:22:40.50,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}But in the end I do nothing but look back
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:45.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}Even when I feel like I've been able to change,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.59,0:22:50.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}Eventually I realize that the only thing that's changed is the position of the stars
Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.89,0:22:57.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(965.143,49.715)\blur0.75}I find myself wondering if everything would feel better if I just broke
Dialogue: 4,0:22:52.89,0:22:57.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(965.143,49.715)\c&HE1BD9B&\blur0.75}I find myself wondering if everything would feel better if I just broke
Dialogue: 3,0:22:52.89,0:22:57.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(965.143,49.715)\c&HCCBAAE&\blur0.75}I find myself wondering if everything would feel better if I just broke
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.89,0:22:57.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(965.143,49.715)\c&H86482E&\blur0.75}I find myself wondering if everything would feel better if I just broke
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.89,0:22:57.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(965.143,49.715)\c&HF7E8D5&\blur0.75}I find myself wondering if everything would feel better if I just broke
